<view class="page"
  ><view class="hero"
    ><view class="eyebrow">YOUR AI TOOLKIT</view
    ><view class="title">找到趁手的 AI。</view
    ><view class="muted">了解能力边界，再决定用什么。</view></view
  ><view class="grid" wx:if="{{modelsEnabled || platformsEnabled}}"
    ><view class="card" wx:if="{{modelsEnabled}}" data-kind="models" bindtap="list"
      ><view class="tag">01 / MODELS</view><view class="card-title">模型库</view
      ><view class="muted">能力、上下文与价格</view></view
    ><view class="card" wx:if="{{platformsEnabled}}" data-kind="tools" bindtap="list"
      ><view class="tag">02 / PLATFORMS</view
      ><view class="card-title">平台导航</view
      ><view class="muted">游戏、3D、视频与效率</view></view
    ></view
  ><view class="card" style="margin-top: 24rpx" bindtap="budget"
    ><view class="tag">03 / BUDGET</view
    ><view class="card-title">Token 费用预算 →</view
    ><view class="muted">输入用量，按公开渠道价格估算费用。</view></view
  ><view class="card" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="eyes"><view class="tag">AI PORTRAIT</view><view class="card-title">AI 眼里的你 →</view><view class="muted">用豆包 / DeepSeek，发现你的 AI 使用人格。</view></view><view class="notice"
    >长文本精确分词、文件分析与完整对比，请在网页版词元计算器使用。</view
  ><button bindtap="copy">复制网页版计算器链接</button></view
>
